                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "physical appearance",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "He was <w>slightly</w> built but tall enough to reach the top shelf easily.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Он был <w>хрупкого</w> телосложения, но достаточно высоким, чтобы легко дотянуться до верхней полки.",
                                "es": "Él era de constitución <w>delgada</w>, pero lo suficientemente alto como para alcanzar el estante superior fácilmente."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The gymnast was <w>slightly</w> framed yet possessed incredible physical strength.",
